@baseUrl = http://localhost/Proyecto-de-Sistemas2026/api/public
@token = pega_aqui_el_token

### Consulta de empleados
GET {{baseUrl}}/empleados
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Adicionar empleado
POST {{baseUrl}}/empleados
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ci": "12345678",
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellidos": "Lopez Rojas",
  "cargo": "ALMACENERO"
}

### Actualizar empleado (cambiar el id por uno existente)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/empleados/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ci": "12345678",
  "nombre": "Ana Maria",
  "apellidos": "Lopez Rojas",
  "cargo": "SUPERVISOR"
}

### Eliminar empleado (cambiar el id por uno existente y sin usuario asociado)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/empleados/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
